```console
$ scherzo-cloud auth identity --help
Manage your linked sign-in identities

Usage: scherzo-cloud auth identity [COMMAND]

Commands:
  link    Link another sign-in identity
  list    List linked sign-in identities
  remove  Remove a linked sign-in identity
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
